      "english_translation": "LOOK: ⛩️ Cosplay Matsuri 2025 ⛩️ Convention Update! Happening Now: Did you know? The last prize has changed! Try your luck at Cosshoppe and get a mystery bag. What awaits inside is your prize! Coming UP Next: 1:00pm Cosplay Auction 2:15pm Performance by Xylia Skylark 2:30pm Anisong It Singing Contest 3:30pm Cosplayer Guest Q&A: Kiyo 3:45pm Doujin Cosplay Duo 4:30pm Performance by As*Fire 4:45pm Trivia Game: Ano Na Wa 5:40pm Cosplay Carnival 2026 Special Guests Reveal 5:45pm Awarding Ceremony 6:00pm Cosplay Auction & Open Mic Karaoke Day 2 and Day 3 Regular Tickets are already SOLD OUT, but Shopper's Pass (6pm-8pm entry) are still available! You can get tickets and other event information at Revel in the snowy splendor of ⛩️ Cosplay Matsuri 2025 ⛩️: Winter Wonderland on December 28-30, 2025 in Function Rooms 2-5 at the SMX Convention Center Manila, Pasay City. Enjoy the Seasons of Cosplay unfold as we celebrate 25 years of cosplay together! #cosplay #cosplayph #cosplaymatsuri2025",
